    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4472" root="ثغو" body-key="v">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَغَتْ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَغُوَ</span></b> , (S, Mgh, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثُغَآءٌ</span>, (S,
[in a copy of the Mgh, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثِغَآء</span>,]) <i>She,</i> or <i>it, bleated,</i>
or <i>cried,</i> (S, Mgh, K,) [<i>on the occasion of bringing
forth,</i> and <i>on other occasions;</i>] said of a sheep or
goat [&amp;c.]. (S, Mgh, K, TA.)

